									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >Puzzle Water Flowers is an engaging puzzle game featuring colorful images of aquatic and shoreline flowers. Piece together beautiful pictures of water lilies, irises, marsh marigolds, lobelias, and other plants that adorn lakes, ponds, rivers, and marshy banks.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >As you progress through the levels, the number of puzzle pieces increases, making the task both more interesting and more challenging. The **gradually increasing difficulty** helps sharpen attention, memory, and logical thinking skills by presenting progressively tougher challenges.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >**Game Features:**</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >* Colorful images of aquatic and shoreline flowers.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >* Increasing difficulty levels.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >* More puzzle pieces with each level.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >* Simple and intuitive controls.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >* Develops memory, attention, and logical thinking.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >* Calm and relaxing gameplay.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >* Suitable for both children and adults.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Assemble all the aquatic flower puzzles, complete every level, and enjoy the beauty of the amazing world of water plants with Puzzle Water Flowers!</p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
